  "scope": "One original isolated PF113001-related metal RH support; no rubber or frame bolts. Editable formed plate, true holes/open tube, independent bent pierced ear, terminal formed saddle with two circles and central slot, original estimated welds. Source-to-material geometry protected, native tangent splits/reindexing reported separately. Historical failed sources remain diagnostics, not relabelled as current. All dimensions/installed pose and currentRDC fit unreceived. Original representative finish starts at working2um RMS with new seed113001; no RH amplitude comparison claimed or coating chemistry/scale measured. Native triangle corner positions/normals/UV protected; source indices/matrices unchanged, native tangents split vertices honestly reported. No auto frame attachment, weld strength, art/OEM/mobile LOD/iPhone reception.",
